{"tab":"all","page":1499,"pages":1604,"count":96213,"pageSize":60,"items":[{"id":"1693614","ru":"Космическая Машка","en":"Космическая Машка","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8XRkC3zZESJKNmwB65VWOFFnN2I.jpg","backdrop":"","genres":["Комедия","Семейный"],"overview":"Машка все свои 11 лет жизни прожила со с отцом-космонавтом на космодроме. Она умеет управлять самолетом, лодкой и отвечать за себя, но не знает как живут ее сверстники. Чтобы обрести товарищей и привыкнуть к земной жизни, девочка отправляется в обычную школу в Петербурге, где и начинается череда её невероятных приключений.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1660550","ru":"Dust Bowls and Jewish Souls: Another Side of Woody Guthrie","en":"Dust Bowls and Jewish Souls: Another Side of Woody Guthrie","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ks5QbH4fE4WDpAFMgQjgFKZdC8a.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xtXmCg5vB3ffTSPP2CgZQX6tsKL.jpg","genres":[],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1707491","ru":"\"Opération dragon\", la révolution Bruce Lee","en":"\"Opération dragon\", la révolution Bruce Lee","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xEXE5dtp9yQNqgM5pOKrsI56lsM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qLUeFnlr4KonxdoLjgNywsPVy3I.jpg","genres":["Документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1704524","ru":"Cocotte","en":"Cocotte","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/srdFkFDaKgjQumjS9UcUerzfsDb.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRqqzNImsJd7ysSphsGnqxESKyv.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1685118","ru":"שיחות עם החבר